It doesn't seems possible to forward static kwargs when a function is wrapped with vmap.
@jax.vmap
def f(x, y, **kwarg):
  return jax.scipy.ndimage.map_coordinates(x, y, **kwarg)

f(x, y, order=1)  #TypeError: batched_fun() got an unexpected keyword argument 'order'
jax.vmap doesn't seems to have an excluded = (like in jnp.vectorize), or static_argnums=, or similar.
Currently, the only solution is to wrap the function is some higher function, like:
def f(x, y, **kwarg):
  f_inner = functools.partial(jax.scipy.ndimage.map_coordinates, **kwargs)
  f_inner = jax.vmap(f_inner)
  return f_inner(y, y)

f(x, y, order=1)  # works

